   587	- **Wave-2 outputs:** `.planning/gsd-2-uplift/wave-2/${slice-or-target-name}/` (per W1 pattern).
   588	- **Trajectory plan:** `.planning/gsd-2-uplift/trajectory/cheerful-forging-galaxy.md` (in-repo; this directory established by Phase A revise-before-execute disposition).
   589	
   590	### §3.3 Cross-reference discipline
   591	
   592	**Every artifact references:**
   593	- Upstream artifact(s) it consumes (FROM).
   594	- Downstream artifact(s) it feeds (TO).
   595	- Decisions it implements (DECISION-SPACE.md §X.Y).
   596	- Methodology it applies (METHODOLOGY.md / spike METHODOLOGY / etc.).
   597	- Audit folder if applicable.
   598	
   599	**Every load-bearing decision is traceable forward and backward.** This is what makes "responsibility traceable backward" possible (Logan's stated requirement).
