+
+<same per-finding structure as Step 1>
+
+# §3. Same-vendor register and comfort-language catches
+
+<focus on what same-vendor is structurally positioned to catch>
+
+# §4. Confidence and limits
+
+<include shared-Claude-frame caveat>
+
